<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">gqiCPdFcCfHNkH</font></font></b></font>

225
00:01:43,370 --> 00:01:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Uzumaki Naruto</font></font></b></font>

226
00:01:43,370 --> 00:01:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Inuzuka Kiba</font></font></b></font>

227
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's here, it's here, it's here!</font>

228
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:49,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What we've been waiting for!</font>

229
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally my turn!</font>

230
00:01:52,210 --> 00:01:54,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Lucky us!</font>

231
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's this guy,
we'll absolutely win, Akamaru!</font>

232
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:03,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show us how much you've grown.</font>

233
00:02:07,270 --> 00:02:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to do it!</font>

234
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Akamaru</font>

235
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Joins</font>

236
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the</font>

237
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Fight!!</font>

238
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Which One Will</font>

239
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">be the Underdog?</font>

240
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The seventh battle,
Uzumaki Naruto versus Inuzuka Kiba.</font>

241
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got sick of waiting!</font>

242
00:02:36,670 --> 00:02:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally time for me to shine!</font>

243
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my line!</font>

244
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With you as my opponent,
I've as good as won!</font>

245
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Akamaru?</font>

246
00:02:48,310 --> 00:02:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get excited!</font>

247
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to beat me!</font>

248
00:02:52,860 --> 00:02:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you little...!</font>

249
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Don't bring your puppy!</font>

250
00:02:58,570 --> 00:03:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll get in the way of the match!</font>

251
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool!</font>

252
00:03:01,410 --> 00:03:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru's going to fight with me.</font>

253
00:03:04,490 --> 00:03:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey! Is that okay?</font>

254
00:03:07,410 --> 00:03:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

255
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Animals and insects are treated
the same as ninja tools.</font>

256
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no problem.</font>

257
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's fine!</font>

258
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a perfect handicap!</font>

259
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Talking tough!</font>

260
00:03:22,390 --> 00:03:23,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

261
00:03:24,350 --> 00:03:26,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, don't put a paw in this.</font>

262
00:03:26,810 --> 00:03:27,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll fight him by myself!</font>

263
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Don't lose to a guy like this!</font>

264
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally come.</font>

265
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, huh?</font>

266
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, but he can't beat Kiba...</font>

267
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi.</font>

268
00:03:46,410 --> 00:03:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

269
00:03:47,580 --> 00:03:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I want to support you, but...</font>

270
00:03:49,540 --> 00:03:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba-kun's on my team...</font>

271
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba-kun will get mad...</font>

272
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:58,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

273
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

274
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba's lucky.</font>

275
00:04:07,510 --> 00:04:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah!</font>

276
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! I don't know how strong he's become
since this guy became a Genin...</font>

277
00:04:16,610 --> 00:04:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today we'll run through Transformation Jutsu.</font>

278
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll change yourself into Hokage-sama...</font>

279
00:04:22,150 --> 00:04:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His ability was "that," so...</font>

280
00:04:29,330 --> 00:04:30,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

281
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So noisy...</font>

282
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was sleeping comfortably...</font>

283
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That was a joke!
I-I did it on purpose!</font>

284
00:04:49,810 --> 00:04:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough, Naruto!</font>

285
00:04:51,770 --> 00:04:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's your third year
at the academy!</font>

286
00:04:53,890 --> 00:04:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

287
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goodness sake, who is that guy?</font>

288
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've just switched to this class
and already found someone funny.</font>

289
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy, he's on a roll.</font>

290
00:05:06,530 --> 00:05:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an attention-seeker, huh?</font>

291
00:05:08,450 --> 00:05:10,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more time, fool!</font>

292
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

293
00:05:21,090 --> 00:05:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

294
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it possible...?</font>

295
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey hey, are you serious?</font>

296
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been here for three years and
can't even do a respectable transformation?</font>

297
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:43,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of you watch now!</font>

298
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:47,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will absolutely someday become
the true and real Hokage!</font>

299
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lame!</font>

300
00:05:51,410 --> 00:05:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Hokage?!</font>

301
00:06:01,210 --> 00:06:02,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some sympathy at the very least...</font>

302
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:05,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do you in, in one clean blow!</font>

303
00:06:05,420 --> 00:06:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? But you can't beat me!</font>

304
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said not to act tough.</font>

305
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:23,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then. Please begin!</font>

306
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art of Beast Mimicry:
All-Four Jutsu!</font>

307
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:35,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come!</font>

308
00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fast!</font>

309
00:06:53,180 --> 00:06:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be a while ‘til
he opens his eyes, Proctor-san.</font>

310
00:06:57,850 --> 00:06:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought.</font>

311
00:06:59,350 --> 00:07:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto can't be equal to Kiba.</font>

312
00:07:02,690 --> 00:07:03,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

313
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:05,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was too embarrassing to watch.</font>

314
00:07:07,570 --> 00:07:08,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See...</font>

315
00:07:09,450 --> 00:07:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?
That guy is weak.</font>

316
00:07:17,580 --> 00:07:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

317
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

318
00:07:27,380 --> 00:07:28,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, that's it...</font>

319
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll surpass Hokage!</font>

320
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then everyone in the village will
acknowledge my existence!</font>

321
00:07:45,770 --> 00:07:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are his words...</font>

322
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've always made fun of them, too.</font>

323
00:07:52,990 --> 00:07:57,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Jonin... a true Ninja...</font>

324
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to escape...</font>

325
00:07:59,330 --> 00:08:00,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I stay like this...</font>

326
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll really, really be killed!</font>

327
00:08:06,210 --> 00:08:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you hurt...</font>

328
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:10,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scaredy cat?</font>

329
00:08:12,380 --> 00:08:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just need to become
stronger than me!</font>

330
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

331
00:08:28,690 --> 00:08:29,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

332
00:08:29,610 --> 00:08:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing all of a sudden?!</font>

333
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:44,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This stupid coward is...
absolutely... not the Sasuke I know!</font>

334
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me!</font>

335
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?</font>

336
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, it was wrong!</font>

337
00:09:03,310 --> 00:09:04,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

338
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are you hurt?</font>

339
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scaredy cat?</font>

340
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't change my words,
that's my Ninja Way!</font>

341
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

342
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say it to everyone!</font>

343
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't...</font>

344
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't...</font>

345
00:09:49,110 --> 00:09:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">underestimate me!</font>

346
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

347
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He seems to have grown
to say such a thing.</font>

348
00:10:00,450 --> 00:10:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...!</font>

349
00:10:01,580 --> 00:10:03,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go, Naruto!</font>

350
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:05,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about,
bleeding like that?</font>

351
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your tough talk has gone too far!</font>

352
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:13,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't use my power fully...
to observe your strength first!</font>

353
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too, cut out the tough talk
and use the dog or whatever you want!</font>

354
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll regret this...</font>

355
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Akamaru!</font>

356
00:10:29,900 --> 00:10:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Smoke Ball?</font>

357
00:10:31,110 --> 00:10:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

358
00:10:53,710 --> 00:10:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see!</font>

359
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

360
00:10:56,210 --> 00:10:58,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to get out of the smoke...
or I'll be done for.</font>

361
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It worked!</font>

362
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it...?</font>

363
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap... I can't see anything.</font>

364
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! We did it!</font>

365
00:11:30,460 --> 00:11:32,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay! Good job, Akama...!</font>

366
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Akamaru...</font>

367
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

368
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

369
00:12:01,530 --> 00:12:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You took the bait!</font>

370
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You!</font>

371
00:12:08,370 --> 00:12:09,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform Jutsu?!</font>

372
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch! Shoot!</font>

373
00:12:11,710 --> 00:12:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go!</font>

374
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:16,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You smell like a dog!</font>

375
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Where's Akamaru?!</font>

376
00:12:19,460 --> 00:12:20,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here!</font>

377
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru! Damn!</font>

378
00:12:25,260 --> 00:12:25,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

379
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Naruto?!</font>

380
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An equal match with Kiba...</font>

381
00:12:29,850 --> 00:12:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it may be more than equal!</font>

382
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Applying Shadow Clone Jutsu
to Transform Jutsu, that's a clever trick.</font>

383
00:12:36,110 --> 00:12:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto shouldn't be able to do that...</font>

384
00:12:39,190 --> 00:12:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His timing at using Jutsus is very good.</font>

385
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? He's better than I thought.</font>

386
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:50,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, to get mad like that after
biting the opponent himself...</font>

387
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a funny guy.</font>

388
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto-kun... amazing!</font>

389
00:12:55,290 --> 00:12:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's amazing, Naruto!</font>

390
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got a little bit stronger.</font>

391
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's over.</font>

392
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, I'll attack you seriously.</font>

393
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh really?!</font>

394
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you will absolutely not beat me!</font>

395
00:13:15,890 --> 00:13:18,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">During this exam,
he's matured again.</font>

396
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a surprise...</font>

397
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Naruto, the perpetual goof...?</font>

398
00:13:27,450 --> 00:13:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evidently it's no longer "that" Naruto.</font>

399
00:13:31,410 --> 00:13:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

400
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder, what kind
of trick Kakashi used...?</font>

401
00:13:38,170 --> 00:13:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still...</font>

402
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

403
00:13:57,190 --> 00:13:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for the development of
my Kiba and Akamaru,</font>

404
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's probably more than Naruto.</font>

405
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... I'll take Akamaru... back!</font>

406
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's this?!</font>

407
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you feed him?
His fur turned red!</font>

408
00:14:30,590 --> 00:14:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why he's called "Akamaru", red boy.</font>

409
00:14:34,970 --> 00:14:36,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Food Pills, huh...?</font>

410
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:38,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Kiba...</font>

411
00:14:39,020 --> 00:14:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He intends to end it with this.</font>

412
00:14:41,110 --> 00:14:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go, Akamaru!</font>

413
00:14:44,730 --> 00:14:46,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art of Beast Mimicry...!</font>

414
00:14:57,370 --> 00:14:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man Beast Clones!</font>

415
00:15:02,750 --> 00:15:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-There's something wrong
with their eyes!</font>

416
00:15:05,210 --> 00:15:07,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's using some weird drug!</font>

417
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't this doping?</font>

418
00:15:09,010 --> 00:15:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this okay?!</font>

419
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:13,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. Food Pills are one of the Ninja Tools.</font>

420
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:16,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, that's all you say!</font>

421
00:15:17,350 --> 00:15:18,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

422
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did that guy eat?</font>

423
00:15:20,890 --> 00:15:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Food Pills.</font>

424
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">F-Food Pills?</font>

425
00:15:24,940 --> 00:15:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Food Pills are a secret medicine
that people in the military take</font>

426
00:15:27,570 --> 00:15:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and fight for three days and
three nights without a break...</font>

427
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:34,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're high in protein,
easily absorbed and</font>

428
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:39,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have some types of component
that influence agitation or sedation...</font>

429
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:46,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba and Akamaru's Chakra must
be doubled right now...</font>

430
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over with this...</font>

431
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:49,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

432
00:15:50,050 --> 00:15:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All-Four...</font>

433
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jutsu!</font>

434
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto!</font>

435
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto is in danger!</font>

436
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba's the gung-ho fighter type
who will attack</font>

437
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:27,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like a beast with Chakra wired
throughout his body.</font>

438
00:16:28,710 --> 00:16:31,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the Food Pills that double one's
Chakra are quite simply...</font>

439
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the perfect pill for Kiba.</font>

440
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:37,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

441
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good...</font>

442
00:16:41,390 --> 00:16:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way to counterattack...</font>

443
00:16:43,020 --> 00:16:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I can do is gather all
the Chakra in my legs</font>

444
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:47,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and do my best to escape...!</font>

445
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate...</font>

446
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:54,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here's my chance!</font>

447
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:56,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

448
00:16:56,700 --> 00:16:58,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man Beast Taijutsu Ultimate Technique!</font>

449
00:17:02,540 --> 00:17:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

450
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:22,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the difference in
our true powers.</font>

451
00:17:31,110 --> 00:17:32,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going...</font>

452
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:34,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to become the Hokage.</font>

453
00:17:36,410 --> 00:17:38,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't lose here...!</font>

454
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:41,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You? Hokage?!</font>

455
00:17:41,370 --> 00:17:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you're weaker than me?</font>

456
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll become Hokage for you!</font>

457
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know deep down inside
that you can't become the Hokage.</font>

458
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So quit acting tough!</font>

459
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:14,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong, Kiba-kun...</font>

460
00:18:16,570 --> 00:18:17,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

461
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not that weak...</font>

462
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll receive the name...
of Hokage-sama!</font>

463
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of you, just watch!</font>

464
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:36,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, unlike me...</font>

465
00:18:37,090 --> 00:18:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he has always believed in his own worth.</font>

466
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it was really amazing...</font>

467
00:18:54,650 --> 00:18:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must have been really hard...</font>

468
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:06,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand that.</font>

469
00:19:08,370 --> 00:19:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yet before not even one person...</font>

470
00:19:15,670 --> 00:19:17,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">tried to see Naruto-kun.</font>

471
00:19:23,800 --> 00:19:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, that's the kid...</font>

472
00:19:26,220 --> 00:19:29,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard he's the only one...
who failed.</font>

473
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! Serves him right!</font>

474
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's trouble if a kid like that
becomes a Shinobi.</font>

475
00:19:35,570 --> 00:19:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, that kid is really...</font>

476
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Anything further is taboo.</font>

477
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody tried to acknowledge
the real Naruto-kun.</font>

478
00:19:53,330 --> 00:19:54,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu!</font>

479
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:09,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now...</font>

480
00:20:12,810 --> 00:20:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's watching...</font>

481
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:23,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up! Naruto!</font>

482
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone is acknowledging him!</font>

483
00:20:46,390 --> 00:20:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you compete with me for
the name of Hokage...</font>

484
00:20:51,930 --> 00:20:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... will be the loser!</font>

485
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

486
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

487
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

488
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

489
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

490
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

491
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

492
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

493
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

494
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

495
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

496
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

497
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

498
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

499
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

500
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

501
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

